{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>李思欣日前在社交平台分享了一條 Vlog，帶領觀眾一同重遊她的母校。</span></p><p id=\"p-rc_984693776afa6357-339\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'></p><p id=\"p-rc_984693776afa6357-339\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>旅程首站，李思欣來到小學母校「香港嘉諾撒學校」。站在校門前的她回憶起當年通往高處的一條旋轉樓梯，又笑言自己當時身形比較嬌小，覺得學校操場非常大，有很多地方可以行，甚至「行極都行唔完」。</span></p><p id=\"p-rc_984693776afa6357-339\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"eccddfc8-6bad-473b-bbd4-940cf24044c7.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026Rn6oQHtWck1788489703.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"eccddfc8-6bad-473b-bbd4-940cf24044c7.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p id=\"p-rc_984693776afa6357-339\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'></p><p id=\"p-rc_984693776afa6357-340\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>隨後，她轉到中學母校「庇理羅士女子中學」，更即場換上中學時期的校服裙，笑言現在穿著感覺有些緊身。她在影片左下角附上一張中學時期的舊照，相中的她剪了一頭短髮，並戴上與校服顏色相襯的髮箍，外表十分清純。李思欣續指，自己中學五年的時光過得非常快樂，當年參與校內合唱團時更曾奪得冠軍。</span></p><p id=\"p-rc_984693776afa6357-340\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'></p><p id=\"p-rc_984693776afa6357-340\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"fa4cfc92-d515-4624-8a19-6befa189fd9b.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026yNiZTOq7Zv1788489702.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"fa4cfc92-d515-4624-8a19-6befa189fd9b.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"cffe5946-54d9-43e7-be85-1e80cd4a9532.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026YBlUZhFaLi1788489702.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"cffe5946-54d9-43e7-be85-1e80cd4a9532.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p id=\"p-rc_984693776afa6357-341\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'></p><p id=\"p-rc_984693776afa6357-341\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>行程的最後一站，李思欣來到母校「香港演藝學院」。她透露當年考入演藝學院絕非易事，一共經歷了三次面試才成功獲錄取。由於自己非常熱愛演戲，因此她十分珍惜在校的每一刻時光，當時每天下午四點放學後，都會與一班同學留在學校裏排戲。</span></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-06T03:58:49.580736+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":377,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}